{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"...","uri":"0d68dba0e9260119f602b5f40d9a022a.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"Aargh! Avaunt foul creature from another dimension! Avaunt! Begone in the name of Saradomin!","uri":"4bfe2a12953cb8273c7b2367693e5883.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"Great! Put it in the ghost's coffin and see what happens!","uri":"94196c1d5abe8a89be2f30a44eda36cc.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"Have you got rid of the ghost yet?","uri":"e81fb8142c677f368cd553780218eae2.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"He who created this world along with his brothers Guthix and Zamorak?","uri":"51127309f77c540a3a2d99a90f3f213f.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"He who creates the forces of goodness and purity in this world? I cannot believe your ignorance!","uri":"52d76eeef109885ef94a6acbcb593eef.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"I always wondered what that amulet was... Well, I hope it's useful. Tell me when you get rid of the ghost!","uri":"ae811829afe7267835a61fcd0924a962.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"I believe he is currently living as a hermit in Lumbridge swamp. He has a little shack in the south-west of the swamps.","uri":"53a648a83549ea05fa814524886e0f77.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"I hate warlocks. Ah well, good luck!","uri":"926e94f45f63b05b220a914040b5d413.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"I thought things not from this world were all... You know. Slime and tentacles.","uri":"deb7e81c37d1b41fe9371a6d71115c89.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"I... beg your pardon?","uri":"2740f61146562cdd46faacecda4428de.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"It is, isn't it? It was built over 230 years ago.","uri":"2222b4e86235b08a236ed8590ca5fcd2.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"My name is Father Aereck by the way. Pleased to meet you.","uri":"8c8fd66d221c296ce323bc42507f8625.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"Oh well. If you do have some spare time on your hands, come back and talk to me.","uri":"1196bf30bc361a8a3191cf43129bdadc.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"Surely you have heard of the god, Saradomin?","uri":"656845dc5f6ac18491edf0590ed860d3.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"Take care travelling through the swamps, I have heard they can be quite dangerous.","uri":"6888e0ada8cb8407199ebcb9c606b425.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"Thank you. The problem is, there is a ghost in the church graveyard. I would like you to get rid of it.","uri":"bf1a595f96c426461293ec21181671e5.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"That WOULD explain it. Hmmmmm. Well, I haven't seen any skulls.","uri":"183d5ebb792fa19dc2aea43fb75d373d.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"That's lucky, I need someone to do a quest for me.","uri":"e8cc0f14af7bd83820406227080a363f.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"That's... strange.","uri":"06ebc900f281077dd629248d138f214d.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"There... is only one Saradomin...","uri":"c5cfb9b7fa978584a7b990f3b8f8726a.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"This is the god with more followers than any other! ...At least in this part of the world.","uri":"76c8e3c3c7183ef7d4ffb1d562e454ed.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"Welcome to the church of holy Saradomin.","uri":"ec4f2edc0e97b4cbdabe76478422018d.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Aereck","text":"Well, you can get to the swamp he lives in by going south through the cemetery. You'll have to go right into the far western depths of the swamp, near the coastline. That is where his house is.","uri":"3fc22b651a25677c5b91b1f693929701.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"Be more careful this time.","uri":"b11b257e05667294fa2d231dfdc16e62.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"Go away! I'm meditating!","uri":"5b0f9ea954a80e4d6bef3f3c5e5a6aab.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"How careless can you get? Those things aren't easy to come by you know! It's a good job I've got a spare.","uri":"e350297f118a8b9b4f76caf106ef8456.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"How careless can you get? Those things aren't easy to come by you know! Now clear some space in your inventory and I'll give you another one.","uri":"0993200250b87130b41f310d10ffe607.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"I leave town for just five months, and ALREADY he can't manage.","uri":"8b5ac058a9e8365bbf6bb3387bff6583.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"I SAID go AWAY.","uri":"c8052ea00268e2eaea8ee9c2b8ed537e.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"I suppose I'd better talk to you then. What problems has he got himself into this time?","uri":"a4f4b683044bd32de71f517a16f3a53b.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"It is an Amulet of Ghostspeak.","uri":"63317e850b653681a0569546f65bf250.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"Maybe if you know what this task is, you can get rid of the ghost. I'm not making any guarantees mind you, but it is the best I can do right now.","uri":"930f9dc3b7b5a1aba2de1c66f3242c07.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"Oh, the silly fool.","uri":"853303e6c3d5251af47bda52f8b6a29d.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"Oh.. go away and stop wasting my time!","uri":"23291d5271e127c5e18658df7c305f18.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"So called, because when you wear it you can speak to ghosts. A lot of ghosts are doomed to be ghosts because they have left some important task uncompleted.","uri":"a188918a8109dbd7ac835fd2c2054564.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"Under what grounds???","uri":"70d0afd94b51bd72af77237e921f191b.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"Well, I can't go back and exorcise it. I vowed not to leave this place. Until I had done a full two years of prayer and meditation. Tell you what I can do though; take this amulet.","uri":"256414b2fdf48fe5477808b80b734acb.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"What are you talking about? I can see you've got it with you!","uri":"70445dfbd361b474b6ce5b3f6b7ec4e9.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"What? But... I don't have a mortgage! I built this house myself!","uri":"b3b7f5614d8ddce601da40c66dd31bed.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"What? What houses? What ARE you talking about?","uri":"c4bdd05aa695f588f4f4f8c56ca2915c.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"Yeah. For example, when we were trainee priests he kept on getting stuck up bell ropes. Anyway. I don't have time for chitchat. What's his problem THIS time?","uri":"f8f8886c705bac2e2deb38d4cee9228d.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Father Urhney","text":"You come here wasting my time... Has it even occurred to you that you've got it stored somewhere? Now GO AWAY!","uri":"0ce0b3e53e93af5832b9db1962680942.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Female","text":"Ah well, better be off now...","uri":"c89225dc0df8d6863a8ae7b852e702f7.mp3"}
