{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Thank you. You've been very helpful.","uri":"19e3b6ddaa8727a028b127b5954e6c94.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Well, if you INSIST.","uri":"c3df3ab3545be3bb9ebfd1357c14f96b.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Well, that's friendly.","uri":"1151466a90eb1ed9ce78fe317200e759.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"What's the problem then?","uri":"19ee5a4e344f6b1bf9dc0658788d3787.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Who's Saradomin?","uri":"154ccd50d30e82764546f7a0017b501b.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Wow, this amulet works!","uri":"cad6a585f65b0bfc58c98a9974974a68.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Yeah, it is a pity. Sorry about that.","uri":"0ef789bce2f20e5e07c29130b446f36a.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Yeah... I, uh, thought you said something else.","uri":"0c3a995fa473458b1f72b0b265c501cf.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Yep, clever aren't I?","uri":"2e655dc2d994760f09c22080c9c6300c.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Yep, now tell me what the problem is.","uri":"187dbd4d7a7f6a9fe2eecf5d16ffae36.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Yes, I think a warlock has stolen it.","uri":"20bd3c9c4005946a82a683e64c972cf9.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"Yes, ok. Do you know WHY you're a ghost?","uri":"1f3de2f0f0db84a10a0c13d5f118c6c8.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"You don't understand. This is an online game!","uri":"c5f39a95c2af8dcf3e9922fa6b360d4d.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"You mean he gets himself into lots of problems?","uri":"ad4831eb5649ca2230db87b84474c710.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Player Male","text":"You'll have to give me the recipe some time...","uri":"3e60d7c52e36e7dea4ac67c263b69d58.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Ah well. Keep on looking. I'm pretty sure it's somewhere in the tower south-west from here. There's a lot of levels to the tower, though. I suppose it might take a little while to find.","uri":"ecc79591a92911b13c569a46249ebb12.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Did you just understand what I said???","uri":"b072194b0b887cc07b9b5ba5abae42aa.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Great. The first person I can speak to in ages...and they're a moron.","uri":"3f3a3fff830d097a2f64d976bdc9a2b8.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Great. The first person I can speak to in ages...and they're an idiot.","uri":"8de79f26b2e8cdb4e306580efd4fad46.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Hang on a second... you CAN understand me!","uri":"5edb26b39c0dce1afc8ae89dd19a576b.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"How are you doing finding my skull?","uri":"31969d52360a6da446201406b1a01065.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Hurrah! Now I can stop being a ghost! You just need to put it in my coffin there, then I'll be free!","uri":"4bdaf455bde091abd46555496f99b4fe.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"I should think it is probably because a warlock has come along and stolen my skull. If you look inside my coffin there, you'll find my corpse without a head on it.","uri":"d098a32f0aee236c2af2f8d018bfd6a3.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"I think it was one of the warlocks who lives in the big tower by the sea south-west from here.","uri":"193572357e5ce14a4ac7798e42f46281.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"I'm impressed. You must be very powerful. I don't suppose you can stop me being a ghost?","uri":"9966b5f356b04c6b826a7a02e8e969df.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"If you just put it in my coffin that should do the trick...","uri":"bd513043412142faaee330d7db3f4404.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Nope. I just know I can't do much of anything like this!","uri":"206ab5380b50e9303e2328f99dd59454.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Not very good actually.","uri":"e3a3328b2fd6983162cae4d225587635.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Oh that's a pity. You got my hopes up there.","uri":"dced78a28b18747c5c8b43a04cab7189.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Oh! It's your amulet that's doing it! I did wonder. I don't suppose you can help me? I don't like being a ghost.","uri":"cb31fa37c0a5c12e7a0bacce0fdbdeb4.mp3"}
{"quest":"The Restless Ghost","character":"Restless ghost","text":"Ooh, thank you. That would be such a great relief! It is so dull being a ghost...","uri":"25e00eaa3b194eb8e0d61bbce316a68a.mp3"}
